The front room. Everyone she ever kept is here.
A man nobody knows stands at the foot of the coffin. He has been there since eight.
MARGARET: Who is he?
  [who "her sister"]
TOM: Mum never said anything about a cousin.
  [who "her eldest"]
GOT_ON: you know exactly who he is.
== dawn
  [card]
Dawn. They carry the chairs back to the kitchen. Tom stands by the coffin with a folded page.
